fixture jump_coyote
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump: "Coyote time 6 f"; s15 "Jump pressed 6 frames after walking off a ledge still jumps"
room test/cliff
spawn 940 320
frames 40
input
  0..13 R
end
expect
  mark off 0..13 state=air
  at off-1 state=ground
  # The walk-off frame the two coyote fixtures count from.
  at off tick=6 air_frames=0 air_jumps=1
end
